<title>FINLAND: SOCCER-SWITZERLAND BEAT FINLAND 3-2 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SWITZERLAND BEAT FINLAND 3-2 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Switzerland beat Finland 3-2 (halftime 2-1) in their World Cup European group three qualifier on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Finland - Antti Sumiala (40th min, penalty), Joonas Kolkka (74th)</p>
<p>Switzerland - Massimo Lombardo (14th), Ciriaco Sforza (34th), Murat Yakin (53rd)</p>
<p>Attendance: 7,220  </p>
<p>Group three standings (tabulate under played, won, drawn,</p>
<p>lost, goals for, against, points):</p>
<p> Norway	    1   1   0   0   5   0   3</p>
<p> Hungary	   1   1   0   0   1   0   3</p>
<p> Switzerland     2   1   0   1   3   3   3</p>
<p> Azerbaijan	2   1   0   1   1   5   3</p>
<p> Finland	   2   0   0   2   2   4   0</p>
<p>Next match: Oct 9 - Norway v Hungary</p>
</text>
